sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SH as Shopify
    participant WR as Webhook Receiver
    participant IB as integration_events<br/>(inbox)
    participant DP as Event Dispatcher
    participant OI as Order Ingestion
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FE as Financial Engine
    participant OPS as Ops Console

    Note over SH,OPS: Requirement 1.2, 2.1, 2.2 - order arrives and is split to item level

    SH->>WR: POST orders/create (HMAC signed)
    WR->>WR: verify HMAC signature
    alt signature invalid
        WR-->>SH: 401 - drop, alert security
    end
    WR->>IB: INSERT (source, external_id, payload)
    Note right of IB: UNIQUE(source, external_id)<br/>duplicate delivery = no-op
    WR-->>SH: 200 OK (under 500ms)

    IB->>DP: dispatch pending event
    DP->>OI: handle OrderCreated

    OI->>DB: upsert ORDERS (#30537)

    loop for each Shopify line item
        OI->>OI: resolve vendor from SKU / product owner
        OI->>OI: resolve fulfilment location<br/>(warehouse vs vendor stock)
        OI->>OI: classify business model<br/>(vendor / private label / retail)
        OI->>DB: INSERT ORDER_ITEMS<br/>item_ref = 30537-1, 30537-2, ...
    end

    Note over OI,DB: Customer still sees a single order #30537.<br/>Internally each item has its own vendor,<br/>status, cost, margin and fulfilment flow.

    OI->>FE: value each item
    FE->>DB: INSERT FINANCIAL_SNAPSHOTS<br/>(append-only, effective_at = order date)
    Note right of FE: Snapshot freezes today's cost,<br/>commission and margin.<br/>Later price changes never<br/>rewrite this row. (Req 6.3)

    OI->>DB: INSERT ITEM_STATUS_HISTORY (status = New)
    OI->>DB: INSERT AUDIT_LOG
    OI->>IB: mark processed

    DP-->>OPS: broadcast - new items in queue
    OPS->>DB: read item-level worklist

    alt handler throws
        DP->>DP: retry with exponential backoff
        DP->>IB: after N attempts, status = dlq
        Note right of DP: DLQ alerts ops.<br/>Payload is retained so the<br/>event can be replayed<br/>after the fix.
    end
